UPS has different departments and working hours. Depending on the department, you can work from 08:00 to 17:00, in two shifts from 06:00 to 15:00 and 15:00 to 00:00, or in shifts from 08:00 to 17:00 and 12:00 to 21:00.

Your tasks can include:- Picking orders with a hand scanner;
- Checking and processing electronic products;
- Packing products and preparing them for shipment;
- Scanning products and processing them in the system;
- Checking the quality and quantity of products;
- Moving goods inside the warehouse;
- Loading and unloading goods;
- Working according to safety and quality rules.

